{"id":"wx2652903380","title":"105位顶尖学者加盟，华农主办国际期刊+1！","published_at":"2026-11-27T09:00:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-11-27","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDlvBj6AmfPfXia0oddXVVyN4iaZXJo8afu3s0k0DMics2R9IujzgUp2RFBWoVLZ8KXS3xDH6JSHgN0fpBtsqzsbBkp8F96Pic2KIc/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"华南农业大学一流学科 作物学建设再落新子 11月26日 由华农主办的国际学术期刊 《分子作物（英文）》 （Molecular Crop）创刊 首届编委会成立并召开第一次会议 会议现场 《分子作物（英文）》（Molecular Crop）创刊…","tags":["科研"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652903380&idx=1&sn=8ac62f3be050ab1023d9e0cf0d350834","paper_url":null,"word_count":1628,"fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:11:46+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2195323138559836160&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCkgI4KMfJNOx9QS58p8AWYr4yoS2NNygwg79FKHRUwpDbvTAnuZ0BEdib3NVKWPOajWz4wcR6mSUv2mSvWUHXy28Hru1Rt7Liaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><span><span>华南农业大学一流学科</span></span></p><p><span><span>作物学建设再落新子</span></span></p><p><span><span>11月26日</span></span></p><p><span><span>由华农主办的国际学术期刊</span></span></p><p><span><span>《分子作物（英文）》</span></span></p><p><span><span>（Molecular Crop）创刊</span></span></p><p><span><span>首届编委会成立并召开第一次会议</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCjErCstM5OvygqNNxAUrQJCsCK5a1OiaNWtoabd1SQFXuHfzSorK4a7Q9DcmNzNkYZTWMqn3b8jxT0vPeCEv1279khJvUG65Ug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>会议现场</span></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckACwhibk5HIhK6pp3ar8ibenHwqBSo1yQZa4R2IKvE6l5egOGYSFG1erRRnCQKy4MjibpsCuYAGlRVicaia8VspfiacoZNr5Om0ZnfqU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>《分子作物（英文）》（Molecular Crop）创刊封面图</span></span></section><p><span><span>该刊为季刊，面向全球开放获取，</span><span>聚焦作物领域前沿交叉方向</span><span>，</span><span>致力于将前沿分子手段与基础研究发现融入下一代作物育种</span><span>，引领作物学科未来发展。首届编委会聚集了来自全球</span><span>13</span><span>个国家的</span><span>105</span><span>位顶尖学者，其中海外编委占比近</span><span>30%</span><span>，</span><span>华农校长薛红卫任主编</span><span>。</span><span>爱思唯尔（Elsevier）提供出版运营支持</span><span>，首期拟于2027年1月出版。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckC1xT8LgiclRNVZVFWvkE3ZlbqQjl1K4fGvZEyPrY5ka8dSjM6cN213PtSUiaUXCpicJ7f9Q3GnkuXcfMwacTS5G0UyzElknf9gGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>华农校长、期刊主编薛红卫在会上致辞</span></span></section><p><span><span>薛红卫表示，作为农林类国家“双一流”建设高校，华农紧扣粮食安全和种业振兴等国家重大战略，扎实推进作物学一流学科建设，取得了一批重要成果，</span><span>植物学与动物学、农业科学进入ESI全球前1‰</span><span>。当前，分子设计育种和合成生物智造正深刻重塑作物科学，</span><span>华农抢抓机遇、前瞻布局，着力打造“农工交叉、理工融合、医农结合”的国际化学术期刊集群</span><span>。作为其中的“排头兵”，《分子作物（英文）》将对标国际顶尖期刊，坚持差异化定位、创新办刊机制、强化运行保障，充分发挥粤港澳大湾区的区位优势，打造高质量的交流平台与优秀人才培育摇篮，为服务高水平科技自立自强和建设科技强国提供有力支撑。</span></span></p><p><span><span>省科技厅参会代表表示，科技期刊建设已纳入国家、广东重大发展战略，华农创办《分子作物（英文）》对抢占作物科学国际学术话语权、推动农业理论创新与成果转化具有重要意义，希望《分子作物（英文）》早日成为现代农业领域具有国际重大影响力的世界一流科技期刊，为推动广东高水平科技自立自强、打造独具特色的南方科技期刊集群作出新的更大贡献。</span></span></p><p><span><span>美国植物生物学家学会（ASPB）前主席、Journal of Systematics and Evolution共同主编马红，Journal of Integrative Plant Biology共同主编巩志忠，Molecular Plant执行主编崔晓峰，Molecular Horticulture共同主编甘苏生，The Crop Journal执行副主编毛龙等代表致贺辞，并分享了新刊建设、国际化运营、审稿体系搭建的实践经验</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAnhSOZAepbXObibicUQOxCpmTYicYuGjd8apgm3icZpBVFqyBAGibvgVwmIzaLB2vNlPERlItEXRNfJWvTFQsOicA9S6QFbxnymHgwE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAic3K02eAjuia2mgxchGQTSWec4TpulweS2MIwzvySl8jkSFicqicvt9YtPO9AhQa5fmDMiaC9xSEkILPTleoqyp9iaKITibmKiaQhWI8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCGzfeJjJicWricD6qpy5naTIc7IEVwnU1lF3RAkwMM8RiagFHloy0BqHIwPZMYDcaENZVktWsw1piaib8Hlo3G3kZkXpic9RGAnu3hg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCkib0w4sMnGMFjjATLn30aGuyKXkdCZc4sBxbl11dRDWviaWFW3pC7zFLsO7LicTKIyceNUqwUR6wiaetVqryLepmtcia9OTIx1cns/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>为首届编委会成员代表颁发聘书</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD4mAAacCCDeXsribHWIy3Pz5DY5hmCb8GF7k6wibicInTYZerfXVibvPkrjIvAiau4bk3JeH4RRomDWlsiaIUaZxVr7B9m5aY8ElfJU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>执行主编孔凡江介绍</span></span><span><span>期刊发展规划</span></span></p><p><span><span>会上，执行主编孔凡江介绍了期刊发展规划，爱思唯尔代表介绍了期刊出版运营的配套保障方案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>首届编委会第一次会议上，</span></span><span><span>来自国内以及澳大利亚、巴西、西班牙、爱尔兰、美国等多个国家的编委围绕期刊中长期发展战略、稿件征集方向、特色专题策划、审稿机制建设、国际传播推广、青年学者扶持等关键议题进行深入交流，为期刊高质量起步提出建设性意见。</span></span></p><p><span><span>据了解，2022年入选“双一流”建设高校以来，华农在作物学领域取得了一批标志性成果</span><span>，开发了国际首个植物基因组整合数据库DeepPGDB与植物功能基因组大模型PlantGPT，建成了全球首个大规模无人化水稻智慧农场，育成了全国唯一的常规丝苗型超级稻，并利用合成生物学首创新种质，选育的大豆和水稻品种出海推广并在多国成功高产，初步构建了“亚非拉”农业科技示范带。今年以来，华农加快国际化学术期刊集群建设，主办的《智慧农业学报（英文）》（Smart Agriculture Journal）已在10月创刊。</span></span></p><p><span><span>扎根南粤大地</span></span></p><p><span><span>争创世界一流</span></span></p><p><span><span>点击下方【往期回顾】</span></span></p><p><span><span>了解华农“双一流”建设更多成果</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652903093&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2196e444df83cf2355bc02957c49ffd5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAWZBVRbjf7KbSIicqZ8EssR8hd9gNWvxiaP2gGXRYV4pbGVpgv6ZKMteCtgK4H0ic9UBdRymr8Ey0ibbYMxTH0lwP5Duo4xBymoQ4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>速看！在这里，读懂华农“双一流”的跃升⏫</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900549&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2c32acb889b129a3e898be026f18e1f0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDh0eKZ9zsodynL4XkdjQP5fVBlcoeiaSMH6xQ0tr4Ch2RD3vBV9KeCVWe2MMp4mF6NM2jhVegbGuqMV8mRcmQRqh49RdgogJDM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>SAJ创刊！华农主办，高标准、国际化！</span><span><span>/</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652902761&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6558f5bc9732c48a580ca8bbac792240&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDAWTOJVL1k2lp9scj3MWCjV7CUMnCyic7pdwu5PfOlUynAEbeMib4YycC5emk4P0yOevwcLDiavkAiceJ25kTRS7Gx1WKbWOjZ4gg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>